<title>ITALY: Italy BTP future on LIFFE forges new record high.</title>
<headline>Italy BTP future on LIFFE forges new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The September Italian BTP future on LIFFE made a new record high of 132.39 in the morning session.</p>
<p>The previous high was set on January 23 at 132.38.</p>
<p>By 1030 GMT the future was 55 basis points up on the day at 132.35.</p>
